  nonce: 986f  # 986f
  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-09-30 (dev 7f0f993843): PARTLY-DONE. The main finding (a mutation inside the gate) holds in the code as written. The second finding's prompt hazard was fixed by 7359007100.\nMAIN FINDING, HOLDS (read, not run):\n- scripts/auto-pr do_pr: _autopr_append_tracker_discussion (def :826, `\"$tracker_bin\" discuss`) is called at :2680. cleanup_local is called at :2685, and cleanup_local removes PR_PENDING at :2697. The flush path has the same order (:1873 then _autopr_flush_cleanup's rm at :1895). So does the already-merged path (:922 then cleanup_local).\n- PR_PENDING holds \"$PR_NUM\" (:1788/:2396), \"preparing\" (:1678/:2226) or \"detached\" (:455), never a PID. Fix option (a) cannot compare a PID from the file; it would have to walk the /proc ppid chain.\n- tracker cli.py: _maybe_auto_sync is at :3331. The wait is at :3413-3428 (_SYNC_PR_WAIT_TIMEOUT=900 at :3298) and still has no holder/ancestor check. Threshold is 80 (sync.py:872).\n- --detach (e9acc336bb, 069b410720) does not change this. The watcher child runs the same do_pr tail.\nSECOND FINDING, PARTLY FIXED:\n- 7359007100 (2026-09-15): the retry prompt is gated on `[[ -t 0 ]]` (:2743). A non-tty run now prints the manual hint and returns. All post-merge housekeeping runs through _autopr_post_merge (:790), so it cannot change the exit code.\n- NOT done: no stash of pending .ops around the post-merge `git pull` (:2705). The hint at :2753 still says `git pull origin <base> && git branch -D`, not `scripts/tracker reconcile` (added by 6a9a0a317f, 2026-09-04). The unguarded `read -p` at :2785 (--squash only) remains.\nNOT MEASURED: whether the 15-minute stall has recurred since 09-03 (no AUTOPR_HISTORY walk done).\nPROPOSED: narrow the row to the main finding. Record 7359007100 as having closed the prompt half. Option (b) still needs needs_human_review (auto-pr is a governance file)."  # 986f
