  message: "OWNER APPROVAL 2026-09-30, recorded by the agent at the owner's request. The owner approves fix option (b) -- in scripts/auto-pr, move the `--tracker-id` discussion write to AFTER the PR_PENDING gate is removed (the end of cleanup_local), on every path that does it (the merged path, the flush path and the already-merged path), so the write runs ungated and auto-sync can fire normally -- and approves merging that change with auto-pr WITHOUT --gov, although scripts/auto-pr is a governance file. Owner's words: \"I approve it and I approve merging it with auto-pr without --gov\". Option (a) is not chosen."  # e3cb
